WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.370
Day twelve.

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.496
Payday.

00:00:02.496 --> 00:00:04.493
After taxes, six hundred eighty-four

00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:06.026
dollars hits your account.

00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:07.129
That feels good.

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:09.462
But before the next payday, your phone bill is

00:00:09.462 --> 00:00:12.492
due, you'll need transportation to work, you agreed to

00:00:12.492 --> 00:00:14.814
help with food at home, and you still owe

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.101
forty dollars you borrowed last week.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:19.598
Your friends also have plans this weekend.

00:00:19.598 --> 00:00:21.037
There isn't one decision that

00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:23.452
makes every priority disappear.

00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:25.681
What do you want your money to protect first?
